{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51737","headline":"送轩辕先生归罗浮山（初，贯休诗名未振。时南楚才人，竞以诗送轩辕先生归罗浮山，计百余首矣。後贯休因吟一章，羣公於是息笔。） · 贯休","name":"送轩辕先生归罗浮山（初，贯休诗名未振。时南楚才人，竞以诗送轩辕先生归罗浮山，计百余首矣。後贯休因吟一章，羣公於是息笔。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉房花洞接三清，谩指罗浮是去程。\n龙马便携筇竹杖，山童常使茯苓精。\n曾教庄子抛卑吏，却唤轩皇作老兄。\n再见先生又何日，只应频梦紫金城。\n（《监诫录》五《禅月吟》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51737.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51737","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}